OL,3,GNEWSASEND school transport delays
OL,4,A'affecting hundreds'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDelays to organising transport for
OL,7,Fchildren with special educational needs
OL,8,F(SEND) to-and-from school are
OL,9,F"affecting hundreds of families", a
OL,10,Fcampaigner has said.
OL,12,FClaire Brenner, from the Oxfordshire
OL,13,FSEND Parent Action Group, said the
OL,14,Fsituation was "worse than ever" for
OL,15,Fparents applying for transport in time
OL,16,Ffor the new school year.
OL,18,FLocal authorities are often legally
OL,19,Frequired to arrange funded transport
OL,20,Ffor many SEND children under education,
OL,21,Fhealth and care plans.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
