OL,3,GNEWSASEND school transport delays
OL,4,A'affecting hundreds'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOxfordshire County Council said there
OL,7,Fwere some delays to applications that
OL,8,Fwere lodged after its deadline, adding
OL,9,Fthat it was aware of an "issue that
OL,10,Fneeds to be resolved".
